      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA596.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🥖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e The French government \u003ca href=\"https://www.wsj.com/tech/elon-musk-summoned-to-france-to-face-criminal-charges-589acd6c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eis accusing\u003c/a\u003e X and Elon Musk of the very things the French government itself is doing:\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e- Illegally collecting \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/durov/500\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003epersonal data\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e- Processing personal data \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/durov/497\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003ewithout proper security\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e- \u003ca href=\"https://www.rferl.org/a/spying-france-snowden-us-internet-telephone-eavesdropping/25037453.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eExtracting data\u003c/a\u003e from automated systems\u003cbr/\u003e- \u003ca href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2013/jul/04/france-electronic-spying-operation-nsa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eViolating the secrecy\u003c/a\u003e of electronic communications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThe French government is panicking. They know a major political shift in 2027 will expose their misdeeds. So they’re trying to silence free speech platforms under whatever pretext they think they can get away with.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5305517652721022708\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29C8A.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e✊\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e The free world should stand with Elon and X against this immoral assault by the French state. Telegram supports our brothers and sisters from X in their fight for our freedoms.",
