      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5231200819986047254\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F938A.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📊\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e\u003cb\u003e \u003c/b\u003eChannel admins can now run massive polls limited to subscribers or specific countries — making fake-vote inflation much harder.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eNow people in places like Russia can see real results. For example, \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/cb_economics/24591\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eonly 5% support internet restrictions\u003c/a\u003e — not 52%, as old rigged polls claimed \u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5384214488809490070\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F988F.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e😏\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e",
